# Popover

Anchored floating panel with flip-on-collision positioning.

<div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-card-foreground">
	<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
		<Popover.Root>
			<Popover.Trigger class="inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border bg-transparent px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent">Options</Popover.Trigger>
			<Popover.Content class="rounded-lg border bg-popover p-4 text-popover-foreground shadow-md">
				<p>Popover body. Click outside or press Escape to dismiss.</p>
				<Button class="inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition-colors hover:brightness-110">Inner action</Button>
			</Popover.Content>
		</Popover.Root>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-card-foreground">
	<h3>With arrow and offset</h3>
	<Popover.Root sideOffset={8}>
		<Popover.Trigger class="inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border bg-transparent px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent">With arrow</Popover.Trigger>
		<Popover.Content class="rounded-lg border bg-popover p-4 text-popover-foreground shadow-md">
			<Popover.Arrow>◆</Popover.Arrow>
			<p>Arrow centers on the trigger edge.</p>
		</Popover.Content>
	</Popover.Root>
</div>

## Anatomy

<CodeBlock code={anatomy} filename="App.svelte" />

## API reference

### Popover.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

Positioning runs on `@floating-ui/dom` (the sole runtime dependency besides Svelte); actual placement surfaces as `data-placement` for arrow styling.

## Keyboard interactions

- Trigger toggles on <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> / <Kbd>Space</Kbd>.
- <Kbd>Esc</Kbd> closes; focus stays where it was (modeless).
